This project is a derivative work of the whole-brain Drosophila leaky-integrate-and-fire
model published with the FlyWire connectome:

  Shiu, P.K., Sterne, G.R., Spiller, N. et al.
  "A leaky integrate-and-fire computational model based on the connectome of the entire
  adult Drosophila brain reveals insights into sensorimotor processing."
  Upstream code: GPL-2.0-or-later.

The upstream model and its connectome tables are GPL-2.0-or-later, so this repository is
distributed under the same licence (see LICENSE). The upstream clone it was derived from
is not vendored here; see README.md for how to fetch it.

Components under other terms, retained here with attribution:

  - Neuron annotations and coordinates: CC-BY-4.0, Schlegel et al. 2024,
    github.com/flyconnectome/flywire_annotations
  - 3-D props: Stylized Nature MegaKit by Quaternius, CC0
  - 3-D fly: the Drosophila melanogaster body model from flybody, developed by Google
    DeepMind and HHMI Janelia Research Campus, Apache-2.0.
      source:   https://github.com/TuragaLab/flybody
                (flybody/fruitfly/assets/blender_model/drosophila.blend, commit 6c50cdc)
      cite:     Vaxenburg R, Siwanowicz I, Merel J, Robie AA, et al. "Whole-body physics
                simulation of fruit fly locomotion." Nature (2025).
      file:     web/public/models/fly/drosophila.glb - a DERIVATIVE of the source, built by
                art/fly/build_fly.py and art/fly/optimize.mjs. Apache-2.0 requires the
                changes to be stated and a copy of the licence to go with the work; both
                are in web/public/models/fly/LICENSE.txt, next to the model.
    Earlier versions of this repository shipped "shy fly" by Maf'j Alvarez (CC-BY-3.0,
    https://poly.pizza/m/8p3PASxvAQr). It is no longer distributed; its credit stays in
    the history of this file for as long as those versions exist.
  - Surface textures: Poly Haven, CC0. CC0 asks for nothing, but the site asks to be
    credited and the assets are worth crediting.
      web/public/tex/moss_*.jpg   https://polyhaven.com/a/forest_leaves_02
      web/public/tex/ground_*.jpg Poly Haven, but which asset was not recorded when it
                                  was fetched and has not been re-identified since.
    Downsampled to 512x512 and re-encoded for page weight; otherwise unmodified.
  - Interface components: @rpgjs/ui-css, MIT

FlyWire connectome data carries its own terms, which are not the same as this repository's
licence. Anything derived from it here is for personal, non-commercial research use.
Check https://flywire.ai before redeploying or building on it.
